Suggested Design Rule

To keep this sane in-game:

2-type combos = specific named reactions

Example: Fire + Spark = Plasma

3-type combos = advanced reactions based on dominant family

Example: Fire + Spark + Glass = Solar Prism

4-type combos = major “super reactions”

Example: Fire + Spark + Glass + Gravity = Eventflare

All 12 = one absurd ultimate

Example: The First Break

That gives you a system that feels huge without becoming a spreadsheet hydra wearing a wizard hat. 🧙‍♂️📊